</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Study exact confidence intervals derived from pivotal quantities.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Investigate the coverage probability of the Wald binomial interval.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the Wilson score interval algebraically.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
